cgtree (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * list: print the cgroup v2 hierarchy as a tree, with --depth, --props
    field filtering, and --format text|json.
  * explore: interactive terminal explorer with live field filtering.
  * Ships man pages and bash, zsh and fish completions.

